{"route":"/docs/6.0/utilities/aspect-ratio/","version":"6.0","renderedVersion":"6.0","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Aspect ratio","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Make elements maintain specific aspect ratios. Perfect for handling videos, slideshow embeds, and more based on the width of the parent."},"blocks":[{"id":"content--table-1","type":"table","caption":[],"rows":[{"head":true,"cells":[{"type":"th","scope":"col","body":[{"id":"content--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Class"}]},{"type":"th","scope":"col","body":[{"id":"content--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"Styles"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"content--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":".ratio-auto"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"content--paragraph-5","type":"paragraph","en":"--bs-ratio: auto;"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"content--paragraph-6","type":"paragraph","en":".ratio-1x1"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"content--paragraph-7","type":"paragraph","en":"--bs-ratio: 1 / 1;"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"content--paragraph-8","type":"paragraph","en":".ratio-4x3"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"content--paragraph-9","type":"paragraph","en":"--bs-ratio: 4 / 3;"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"content--paragraph-10","type":"paragraph","en":".ratio-16x9"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"content--paragraph-11","type":"paragraph","en":"--bs-ratio: 16 / 9;"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"content--paragraph-12","type":"paragraph","en":".ratio-21x9"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"content--paragraph-13","type":"paragraph","en":"--bs-ratio: 21 / 9;"}]}]}]},{"id":"content--paragraph-14","type":"paragraph","en":"Use the ratio utility to manage the aspect ratios of content like <code>&lt;iframe&gt;</code>s, <code>&lt;embed&gt;</code>s, <code>&lt;video&gt;</code>s, and <code>&lt;object&gt;</code>s. These helpers also can be used on any standard HTML child element (e.g., a <code>&lt;div&gt;</code> or <code>&lt;img&gt;</code>). Customize the available aspect ratios with the Sass variable or the utility API."},{"id":"content--note-1","type":"note","tone":"info","body":[{"id":"content--note-text-1","type":"note-text","en":"<strong>Pro-Tip!</strong> You don’t need <code>frameborder=&quot;0&quot;</code> on your <code>&lt;iframe&gt;</code>s as we override that for you in <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/content/reboot\">Reboot</a>."}]},{"id":"example","type":"heading","en":"Example","level":2},{"id":"example--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Add your ratio utility to the element you want to modify, like an <code>&lt;iframe&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;video&gt;</code>, or less semantic elements like <code>&lt;div&gt;</code>. Ratio utilities also pair well with any width utilities, as shown below. Customize the available aspect ratios with the Sass variable or the utility API."},{"id":"example--example-1","type":"demo","key":"d9318a9ecc7cebd6de3c","height":147},{"id":"example--code-1","type":"code","value":"<iframe class=\"w-100 ratio-16x9\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/zpOULjyy-n8?rel=0\" title=\"YouTube video\" allowfullscreen></iframe>","language":""},{"id":"example--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Swap the <code>.ratio-*</code> class for a different aspect ratio."},{"id":"example--example-2","type":"demo","key":"40da2efb083ff6fa87a1","height":300},{"id":"example--code-2","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"ratio-auto\">\n  <div>Auto</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-25 ratio-1x1\">\n  <div>1×1</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-50 ratio-4x3\">\n  <div>4×3</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-75 ratio-16x9\">\n  <div>16×9</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-100 ratio-21x9\">\n  <div>21×9</div>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"custom-ratios","type":"heading","en":"Custom ratios","level":2},{"id":"custom-ratios--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"To set a custom ratio, override <code>--bs-ratio</code> on any <code>.ratio-*</code> element."},{"id":"custom-ratios--example-1","type":"demo","key":"28b414b46933b5a175d2","height":147},{"id":"custom-ratios--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"w-25 ratio-auto\" style=\"--bs-ratio: 2 / 1;\">\n  <div>2×1</div>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"custom-ratios--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"You can also change the ratio at breakpoints by overriding the same custom property in your own CSS."},{"id":"custom-ratios--code-2","type":"code","value":".custom-ratio {\n  --bs-ratio: 4 / 3;\n\n  @include media-breakpoint-up(md) {\n    --bs-ratio: 2 / 1;\n  }\n}","language":""},{"id":"custom-ratios--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"Then apply that class to your markup:"},{"id":"custom-ratios--code-3","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"ratio-auto custom-ratio\">\n  <div>4×3, then 2×1</div>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"css","type":"heading","en":"CSS","level":2},{"id":"sass-map","type":"heading","en":"Sass map","level":3},{"id":"sass-map--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Within <code>_config.scss</code>, you can change the aspect ratios you want to use. Here’s our default <code>$aspect-ratios</code> map. Modify the map as you like and recompile your Sass to put them to use."},{"id":"sass-map--code-1","type":"code","value":"$aspect-ratios: ();\n// stylelint-disable-next-line scss/dollar-variable-default\n$aspect-ratios: defaults(\n  (\n    \"auto\": auto,\n    \"1x1\": #{\"1 / 1\"},\n    \"4x3\": #{\"4 / 3\"},\n    \"16x9\": #{\"16 / 9\"},\n    \"21x9\": #{\"21 / 9\"}\n  ),\n  $aspect-ratios\n);","language":""},{"id":"sass-utilities-api","type":"heading","en":"Sass utilities API","level":3},{"id":"sass-utilities-api--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Aspect ratio utilities are declared in our utilities API in <code>scss/_utilities.scss</code>. <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/utilities/api#using-the-api\">Learn how to use the utilities API.</a>"},{"id":"sass-utilities-api--code-1","type":"code","value":"\"aspect-ratio-attr\": (\n  selector: \"attr-includes\",\n  class: \"ratio-\",\n  property: aspect-ratio,\n  values: var(--ratio),\n),\n\"aspect-ratio\": (\n  property: --ratio,\n  class: ratio,\n  values: $aspect-ratios\n),","language":""}],"demos":[{"key":"d9318a9ecc7cebd6de3c","html":"<iframe class=\"w-100 ratio-16x9\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/zpOULjyy-n8?rel=0\" title=\"YouTube video\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"40da2efb083ff6fa87a1","html":"<div class=\"ratio-auto\">\n  <div>Auto</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-25 ratio-1x1\">\n  <div>1×1</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-50 ratio-4x3\">\n  <div>4×3</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-75 ratio-16x9\">\n  <div>16×9</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-100 ratio-21x9\">\n  <div>21×9</div>\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example bd-example-ratios"},"sprite":""},{"key":"28b414b46933b5a175d2","html":"<div class=\"w-25 ratio-auto\" style=\"--bs-ratio: 2 / 1;\">\n  <div>2×1</div>\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example bd-example-ratios"},"sprite":""}],"nav":[{"en":"Install","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/install"},{"en":"AI","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/ai"},{"en":"Approach","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/approach"},{"en":"CSS variables","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/css-variables"},{"en":"JavaScript","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/javascript"},{"en":"Browsers & devices","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/browsers-devices"},{"en":"Accessibility","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/accessibility"},{"en":"Quickstart","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/guides/quickstart"},{"en":"npm","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/guides/npm"},{"en":"Webpack","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/guides/webpack"},{"en":"Parcel","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/guides/parc